	(text "AUDIO: DAC or radio audio -> class-D amp -> speaker; DAC and mic -> radio mic; radio audio or mic -> ADC"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 13.2 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.5 2.5)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "58b47120-46f2-4b30-baa3-dcb425669842")
	)
	(text "NS4150B gain = 2 x 240k / 220k = 2.2. MUX_SEL low = ESP32 DAC to the speaker, high = radio receive audio to the speaker."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 16.9 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "611149e9-dac1-4ecc-8467-e1a4186ccef7")
	)
	(text "SOURCE SELECT (TS5A3159)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 13.5 21 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "9e48114e-2d0d-4390-ae8a-341ceede7efc")
	)
	(text "DAC1 is 0-3.3 V unipolar; R501 limits current into the switch.\nAC coupling after the switch (C501)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 92 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "8400a7e3-e700-4547-8486-60bfcb19dee5")
	)
	(text "CLASS-D AMPLIFIER (NS4150B) + 30 mm SPEAKER"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 159.5 21 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "5a6befeb-184a-4f47-ba70-f1c57289e58b")
	)
	(text "R504 keeps the amp off until firmware drives AMP_SD high; R511 limits the current into CTRL while VBAT_SW is off.\nFirmware: AUX_EN high a few ms before AMP_SD high, AMP_SD low before AUX_EN low."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 250 76 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "216613cf-6378-4713-92b7-88847e32978d")
	)
	(text "Filter-free BTL output: keep speaker traces short and away from the radio. VCC on VBAT_SW with 470 uF bulk.\nMax output about 1 W into 8 ohm at 3.7 V."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 160 97 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "a24c40b3-9e5e-47a5-8daf-864989eb2802")
	)
	(text "DAC -> RADIO MIC_IN (100:1)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 13.5 114 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "c49bf886-9d73-4979-9e66-fb4a3e700e70")
	)
	(text "3.3 Vpp DAC -> 33 mVpp at MIC_IN, AC coupled; MIC_TX adds the\nmicrophone (about 9 mVrms speech). DTMF, tones and voice over the radio."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 177 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "99f40bbc-b5d7-4ff2-ab3e-f25d59064649")
	)
	(text "ADC INPUT MUX (TS5A3159): RADIO AF_OUT or MIC -> ADC1 (software Goertzel DTMF decoder)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 159.5 114 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "8dd30727-9f07-4e44-8233-2596c72867eb")
	)
	(text "AF_OUT is 700 mV / 200 ohm: R507 with the 50k bias gives about 0.35 Vrms swing around 1.65 V at GPIO36; R515 passes 0.7 of MIC_AMP.\nADC_SEL high (expander default) = radio, low = microphone. R510/C510 = 16 kHz anti-alias for a 40 kHz ADC sample rate."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 160 177 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "42540bc9-a994-4c53-983d-deafa2d3fcb7")
	)
	(text "MICROPHONE: MEMS mic -> LMV321 x48 -> radio MIC_IN (muted by default) and ADC mux"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 13.5 199 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "b01c507b-e241-49c8-86dc-dd14f7178db5")
	)
	(text "MSM421ACT006: -42 dBV/Pa, 170 ohm output, 1.5 to 3.6 V, top port (hole in the enclosure above it). Runs on LCD_3V3 through R516/C512.\nU504 gain 1 + R520/R521 = 48 (34 dB), bandwidth about 20 kHz from the 1 MHz GBW, output biased at LCD_3V3 / 2 (MIC_VMID).\nSpeech at 20 cm gives about 100 mVrms at MIC_AMP; R513/R514 into the 1k DAC node give about 9 mVrms at MIC_IN (rated deviation).\nQ501 shorts the radio path unless MIC_MUTE is low (expander default high = muted). ADC path: R515 into U503 with ADC_SEL low.\nOff in sleep with LCD_3V3 (about 0.3 mA when on). Firmware mutes the speaker while the mic is live or the radio transmits."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 165 206 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "4f0704a6-48fb-4a0c-9536-91b1f0951579")
	)
